{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glaivestorm is an isometric ARPG with combat, loot, stats, spells and sprinkle of crafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is focused on combat with 4 different playstyles which you can mix in any way you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellcaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee and Ranged mode can be switched at any time and can be used with any weapons - they just have different ranges and projectile mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive style requires at least one shield equipped, gives you ability to block attacks are reflect damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellcaster focuses on magic with different elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stat system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm trying to make the stat system as transparent as possible to not hide how things are calculated. The big part of the desire to create this game was frustration from a lot of games forcing players to guess or straight up lying to the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an example, in Glaivestorm if you see an item giving &quot;+10% strength&quot; you can be sure that it adds 10% to whatever strength you already have, not to some base value. Plus, when you have three such items, they don't just add up to 30% bonus, but multiply with each other to give a proper 33.1% increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/865209b326b601c7db98cf3e08616258.avif?t=1759853332\" width=900 height=486 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment have different rarity, which affects their stats and how many effects they can have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an upgrade system to improve main stats (such as damage and armor).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can atomize gear to get materials and swap the majority of the bonus effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessory slots are heavily limited in many games. Glaivestorm allows players to wear up to ten rings and two amulets at the same time (although not all gear slots are available from level zero).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/b2304c62ac620d43ef2f74f2edc1cfd1.avif?t=1759853332\" width=754 height=472 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree is still in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are both active and passive skills. Some of them benefit not just their respective path, so you're free to combine and find what's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like with stats I'm trying to make all the calculations as transparent as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/791ee3050cc511f02a459778cf5f16bd.avif?t=1759853332\" width=1158 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most locations where you fight monsters are procedurally generated, but there's also boss arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are complete conditions, finishing which will unlock new locations and give bonuses for future revisiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are not level restricted. If you can gain access to them earlier than the recommended level - good for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, you can find treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/95419b106eed107f8bd813001f8edb44.avif?t=1759853332\" width=1468 height=960 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Climbed a hill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/a3d1f4f8af90e13801db03c433957e8e87e781d6.jpg"},{"name":"Everest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/51b6a39421c22a895f41bc131b4b8fcb933086e3.jpg"},{"name":"Olympus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/741e482ef426b62fe3a36daab0bfc83c46f4c802.jpg"},{"name":"Consistency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/743919bbefa3ebce40c0d55b0adf213e546b43f0.jpg"},{"name":"Powerful punch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/e30a87049faf095106c4e05cb3f10530b90c2362.jpg"},{"name":"One-Punch man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/91964857710d284decbebe5851b13ca9da118051.jpg"},{"name":"Thor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/e00336b98eab77deacda9a35bfe73d46f33cc296.jpg"},{"name":"Flash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/bdc16394dafa8e33d07e651b1c58fe4ed9d85f64.jpg"},{"name":"Megamind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/c25ed171fc01ed25f3212da7f989e8eb8e3eec93.jpg"},{"name":"Nanomachines, son!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937630/3e8a4ac3c624ba27f9527ba3c45c6fed529eb289.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937630?t=1759853332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/974f7597e82eb43fec23899b213fd6d65a07297b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759853332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/468a1ce6304851fcd0897ee4f83c0c33c0b75bdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759853332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/468a1ce6304851fcd0897ee4f83c0c33c0b75bdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759853332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glaivestorm is an isometric ARPG with combat, loot, stats, spells and sprinkle of crafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is focused on combat with 4 different playstyles which you can mix in any way you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/9a7b4b170b7d78444cce763a55fdd324.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/e6f918f7390073dc2cce2b2cac696aa0.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/6c03a1f7c44cc54b8656c5ff6f01f88e.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellcaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.poster.avif?t=1759853332\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.webm?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/cd0d7bcb9a2e8e5262de1a2c0a67c410.mp4?t=1759853332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee and Ranged mode can be switched at any time and can be used with any weapons - they just have different ranges and projectile mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive style requires at least one shield equipped, gives you ability to block attacks are reflect damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellcaster focuses on magic with different elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stat system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm trying to make the stat system as transparent as possible to not hide how things are calculated. The big part of the desire to create this game was frustration from a lot of games forcing players to guess or straight up lying to the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an example, in Glaivestorm if you see an item giving &quot;+10% strength&quot; you can be sure that it adds 10% to whatever strength you already have, not to some base value. Plus, when you have three such items, they don't just add up to 30% bonus, but multiply with each other to give a proper 33.1% increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/865209b326b601c7db98cf3e08616258.avif?t=1759853332\" width=900 height=486 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment have different rarity, which affects their stats and how many effects they can have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an upgrade system to improve main stats (such as damage and armor).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can atomize gear to get materials and swap the majority of the bonus effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessory slots are heavily limited in many games. Glaivestorm allows players to wear up to ten rings and two amulets at the same time (although not all gear slots are available from level zero).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/b2304c62ac620d43ef2f74f2edc1cfd1.avif?t=1759853332\" width=754 height=472 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree is still in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are both active and passive skills. Some of them benefit not just their respective path, so you're free to combine and find what's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like with stats I'm trying to make all the calculations as transparent as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/791ee3050cc511f02a459778cf5f16bd.avif?t=1759853332\" width=1158 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most locations where you fight monsters are procedurally generated, but there's also boss arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are complete conditions, finishing which will unlock new locations and give bonuses for future revisiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are not level restricted. If you can gain access to them earlier than the recommended level - good for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, you can find treasures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/extras/95419b106eed107f8bd813001f8edb44.avif?t=1759853332\" width=1468 height=960 /></span></p>","developers":["Blue glass star"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937630/11d3b86ad968c750558e6d8412839c4cfef2e7b1/header.jpg?t=1759853332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937630/1719446174/0c2de746e3544d8354ddd2b51b7a6d79f8437335/1757348035/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757529437","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937630/1719446174/0c2de746e3544d8354ddd2b51b7a6d79f8437335/1757348035/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757529437","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937630/1719446174/0c2de746e3544d8354ddd2b51b7a6d79f8437335/1757348035/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757529437","id":257194619,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194619/movie480.mp4?t=1757529437","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194619/movie_max.mp4?t=1757529437"},"name":"Glaivestorm trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194619/01f6e3885d57c01878a375f1c3dc4643a9ced65a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757529437","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194619/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757529437","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194619/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757529437"}}],"name":"Glaivestorm","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_t